 "ranks": "author-top-cards, 2026-11-16: the untriaged queue was empty, so the batch took the best-ranked cards missing from the pool in EDHREC order. The rank goal's ten (ranks 3632-8983, all majors the user approved this session): Nicol Bolas, Dragon-God and Lich's Mastery (exile-from-zones), New Blood (creature-type text change), _____ Goblin (name stickers), Karn Liberated (restarting the game, rule 727), Soulfire Eruption (targets in turn order), Spectral Searchlight (another player's colour inside a mana ability), Pulmonic Sliver (an optional graveyard replacement asked as the move happens), Night Shift of the Living Dead (a die shifted after the roll) and Zilortha (lethal damage by power) - so every card to EDHREC rank 10,000 is now in the pool. Then the triaged cards past rank 10,000 in rank order to 11328 (Preacher and Wish from the freed queue), each with the small feature it waited on, plus the cards that shared a key. Built by the lead and fourteen worktree agents (9 majors, 14 groups of small keys); design records in docs/plans for each major.",
